{
  "area": "world",
  "phase": "F2 production complete (awaiting review)",
  "notes": {
    "anchors": "Tiles: centre. Objects: bottom-centre; sprite bottom sits on the tile's bottom edge. Buildings are 40x48 (40x40 footprint + max 8 px upward overhang); bldg-a re-cut from 40x56 to 40x48. Courier: feet at row 42 of 48 (anchor y 0.875).",
    "tile-park": "Same image as tile-park-lush (default park state).",
    "tile-water-h": "The vertical canal rotated 90 degrees, so both canals match exactly.",
    "tool-cool-roof": "Transparent placement overlay: white reflective roof panel with solar panels and a small shine sparkle; roof block sits at rows 9-32 of 40x48.",
    "not-provided": "tile-building is not delivered; buildings stand on tile-lot.",
    "courier": "v2 design (PixelLab v3, high top-down). All 10 courier files share one 16-colour set. Sheets are horizontal strips of 48x48 frames, no spacing: walk-s/e/n/w 6 frames (10 fps, loop), idle-s 4 (5 fps, loop), deliver 5 (8 fps, once; template picking-up). The north walk and static north show a cross on the jacket instead of the back box (two PixelLab templates both dropped the box from behind)."
  },
